The forward map is
\[
y = H x
\]
The later residual, using that same operator and solution vector, is
\[
r = b - H x
\]
\end{document}

\section{Tentative Newton step}
Let \(x_k\) and \(x_{k+1}\) be scalar iterates, with scalar function and derivative values at \(x_k\). The derivative is not asserted nonzero.
\[
x_{k+1} = x_k - \frac{f(x_k)}{f'(x_k)}
\]

